{"ref":"BDB, צָרַ֫עַת","hw":"צָרַ֫עַת","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">צָרַ֫עַת</span></big><sub>35</sub>  <strong>n.f. leprosy</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.8\">Dt 24:8</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרָ֑עַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.2\">Lv 13:2</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרַ֫עַת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.27\">2 K 5:27</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרַעְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.3\">2 K 5:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.7\">7</a>;—<em>leprosy</em> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.3\">2 K 5:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>; elsewhere only in laws: <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶגַע צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.8\">Dt 24:8</a>, and <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13\" href=\"/Leviticus.13\">Lv 13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14\" href=\"/Leviticus.14\">14</a> (P; 29 times): <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹרַת הַצּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:57\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.57\">14:57</a>; specif. of<br><strong>a.</strong>  human disease (as above) <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶגַע צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.2\">Lv 13:2</a> + 8 times; without <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.8\">13:8</a> + 10 times<br><strong>b.</strong>  <em>leprosy</em> in a garment <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:47\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.47\">13:47</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:49\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.49\">49</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:51\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.51\">51</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:52\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.52\">52</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:59\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.59\">59</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(תּוֹרַת נֶגַע צ׳ בֶּגֶד)</span>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  in house <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.34\">14:34</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(נֶגַע צ׳)</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:44\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.44\">44</a>; house or garment v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:55\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.55\">55</a>.—Exact meaning of <strong>b.</strong> and <strong>c.</strong> dub., perhaps some fungus or mould; v. especially Di Dr-Wh Baen.","next":"BDB, צָרַע","prev":"BDB, צרע"}